    "norm": "Tests that {@link AccountingDate#with(java.time.temporal.TemporalAdjuster)} correctly applies a standard {@link TemporalAdjusters} adjuster to an Accounting calendar date. <p>The chronology used throughout: ends on SUNDAY nearest the end of AUGUST, divided into 13 equal 4-week periods, with the leap week appended to period 13."
