    "norm": "Verifies that applying {@code lastDayOfMonth()} to a date in a standard 28-day period moves the date to day 28 of that same period. <p>Period 6 of accounting year 2012 is a regular (non-leap) period with 28 days, so the last day of the period is day 28."
   }
